				while file.get_position() < file.get_length():
					# Read data


				while (file.GetPosition() < file.GetLength())
				{
					// Read data
				}

set_get_thumbnail_callback.description:
Sets the callback used by the  nodes to get a file icon, when  mode is used. The callback should take a single  argument (file path), and return a . If an invalid texture is returned, the  icon will be used instead.
				Thumbnails are usually more complex and may take a while to load. To avoid stalling the application, you can use  to asynchronously create the thumbnail.

