					var values = variation_list
					print("variation axis: %s (%d)\n\tmin, max, default: %s" % )

				Note: To set and get variation coordinates of a , use FontVariation.variation_opentype.

FontVariation.description:
Provides OpenType variations, simulated bold / slant, and additional font settings like OpenType features and extra spacing.
